                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Wonderful game. This game is actually a fandisc of the orginal game Princess Evangile. This game has the first 13 chapters of the common route included from the first game. However, Chapter 14-16 are not inclued because the new heroines' routes, \"Another Story\", starts immediately after chapter 13. So Chapter 14-16 are not needed. However, For the original heorines's after stories, you will need to play the first game to see chapter 1-16 of the common route and also play their individual routes.\n\nThis game has after stories for those four heroines of the first game, and in addiition there are five new heroines' Routes. So that’s a total of four After Stories and five new heroines' Routes. All the heroines themselves are given their own unique traits and distinct personalities. It’s very interesting to see their character developement throughout the course of the game. Each girls have their own motives and goals as well as conflicts which the Protagonist must help them overcome. In addition the character interactions in the game are funny and enjoying.\n\nThe art and character designs are very beautiful and well drawn. The music is very well done and fits the mood. The game is pretty long and very satisfying so it’s definitely worth the price. If you want to play the game with h-scenes you can download the 18+ patch for free.\n\nI really enjoyed this  game and I recommend others to play it as well.",
